TBag-fufu - Licensing & Heritage Notice
=======================================

TBag-fufu is a personal revival fork of an ABANDONED World of Warcraft addon.
Its lineage is:

    Engbags  ->  TBag (Talos)  ->  tbag-shefki (Shefki)  ->  tbag-fufu (this fork)

ORIGINAL CODE
-------------
The upstream addon (TBag, by Talos, modified by Shefki -- itself originally
built by modifying Engbags) shipped with NO license file and stated no license
terms in its source, its .toc, or its readme. Absent an explicit grant, the
original code remains under the copyright of its respective original authors,
with all rights reserved by them.

This fork makes no claim of ownership over that original code and does not (and
cannot) relicense it. The original code is preserved and modified here in good
faith as a community revival of an addon whose upstream is no longer maintained,
consistent with the long-standing norms of the WoW addon community and the
distribution terms of CurseForge / WoWInterface where TBag was published.

If you are an original author and wish to change how your work is hosted here,
please open an issue at https://github.com/Little-Bunny-FuFu/tbag-fufu and it
will be honored.

